*** Settings ***
Documentation
    ...  This test case is created to trigger SoC recovery.
    ...  Test will randomly select SoC from ABIN, ABIO or ABIP.
    ...  Fault will be generated by crashing DSP resulting in L1Soc NR UL DSP group.
    ...  Fault will be generated by crashing again DSP within "reset loop time period" on the same L1 Soc.
    ...  Fault id 9100 with fault name "SoC autonomous reset as recovery action" should appearn in WebEM.
    ...  Also recovery action will be checked and counter is incremented correctly.

Resource  ../../common_resources/ca_FM_general.robot


*** Variables ***
${STARTUP_TIMEOUT}  600  # Timeout for SBTS to recover after site reset
${FAULT_NUMBER}  9000  # Fault that must be set in faultSnapshotTriggers
${TRIGGER_TYPE}  onFaultDetection  # Trigger type that must be set in faultSnapshotTriggers
${RAT_TYPE}  NR  # SOC's cells type
${UNIT_TYPE}  ${EMPTY}  # Mandatory. BBMOD type can be ABIO, ABIN, aSOE, ABIP, SMOD: ASOF,ASOE
${CRASH_COMMAND}  devmem 0x87E044281600 64 1  # Command to trigger the crash
${CRASH_COMMAND_ABIP}  devmem 0x87E044201600 64 1  # Command for ABIP to trigger the crash


*** Keywords ***
